  m_text: In order to play, you will need to collect experience drops from enemies
    with your finger. By collecting experience you increase your level, the level
    opens up new abilities for you to protect yourself from enemies. Also, thanks
    to experience, you can improve your existing abilities. Everything is easy and
    simple Collect experience and improve your abilities. Good luck !
